\item[S2] Carla Groenland, Sean Longbrake, Raphael Steiner, Jérémie Turcotte and Liana Yepremyan, Longest Cycles in Vertex-Transitive and Highly Connected Graphs, arXiv:2408.04618v2 (2025), Section 1, page 2, Lovász’s 1969 Hamiltonian-path question. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2408.04618v2}.
